		<<if $schoolrep.herm gte 5 and !$worn.face.type.includes("mask")>>
			<<addinlineevent "fame_herm">>
				<<generatey1>><<generatey2>><<generatey3>> 당신의 뒤에서 세 명의 학생이 속삭이는 소리가 들린다.
				<br><br>
				/* Note: This event could stand to be expanded for pregnant PCs, but I am woefully underqualifed
				to even begin to attempt to handle that. I've never played as a herm or had a pregnancy, so I have
